{
  "name": "UberLLM: product photo → person holding it → 9:16 clip → voice-over",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Product photo → person holding it → 9:16 clip → voice-over (UberLLM)\nThe most copied AI ad recipe, on one API key:\n1. **Make still**: `google/nano-banana-2-edit` puts your product in a person's hand, as a 9:16 picture.\n2. **Start video**: `kling/kling-o3-standard-image-to-video` animates the still into a 5 s clip (the still is the first frame, so the clip is 9:16 too).\n3. **Voice-over**: `venice/kokoro-tts` reads your line as an mp3.\n4. **Ad package** holds `still`, `clip` and `voice` as binary data, and the command that joins them.\n\n### Setup (2 minutes)\n1. Get a key at https://uberllm.dev (sign in with your email, add credit).\n2. Open any **UberLLM** HTTP node → Credential → **Create new** → *Header Auth*:\n   - Name: `Authorization`\n   - Value: `Bearer YOUR_UBERLLM_KEY`\n   Every UberLLM node in this workflow uses this one credential.\n3. Edit the **Settings** node, then click **Execute workflow**.\n\n`product_image_url` must be a public `https://` link to the product photo. A plain background works best.\n\n### Join clip and voice\nUberLLM does not join files. On any computer with ffmpeg:\n`ffmpeg -i clip.mp4 -i voice.mp3 -map 0:v:0 -map 1:a:0 -c:v copy -c:a aac -af apad -shortest ad.mp4`\n(the clip keeps its length; the voice is padded with silence). Captions and avatars are not part of this workflow.\n\n### Price\nListed on 2026-11-19: 1 still at $0.04 each + a 5 s clip at $0.07 per second = about $0.39, plus the voice line (well under a cent). Live prices: https://uberllm.dev/ai-ad-creative-api\n\n### What you pay\n- The start reply shows the price now (`estimated_cost_usd`). The bill is what the provider charged, which can differ if the job moves to another provider.\n- Your ceiling is `max_cost` in **Settings**: a job that would cost more is refused or cancelled at no charge.\n- A video that fails or runs out of time costs nothing: the whole hold comes back.\n- Credit you buy does not expire while your account is open.\n- No UberLLM fee on requests. Adding credit by card costs 5.5% + $0.50.\n\n### Files are short-lived\nPicture links are kept about 15 minutes and video links about 3 hours, and they need your key. The workflow downloads every result at once, so the last node holds the files as binary data: send them to Drive, S3 or your ad tool from there.\n\n### Why the still is uploaded\nA result link needs your key, so a video model cannot open it. **Upload still** puts the picture in your UberLLM files (kept 24 hours) and the clip starts from that upload.\n",
        "height": 1240,
        "width": 600
      },
      "id": "7b7241f2-af4d-52c1-8d6d-2782fff890fa",
      "name": "About",
