    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Before you run ads\n- People in these pictures and clips are AI-generated. Label them as AI where the platform or the law asks, and never present one as a real customer or a testimonial.\n- No health claims and no before/after pairs: Meta's ad rules apply whatever tool made the creative.\n- Check the model maker's terms for commercial use, and use only product photos you have the rights to.\nLinks to Meta's rules and each maker's terms: https://uberllm.dev/ai-ad-creative-api\n",
        "height": 330,
        "width": 620,
        "color": 3
      },
      "id": "b566b409-0338-516a-8aac-d450302874a7",
